# Version / tag numbers require an explicit human choice

Never choose, bump or retarget a toolkit version, tag or `WIP/improvements-*` / `chore/release-v*` name on your own. The rule, and the block to print while you wait for the user's number, is stated once in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md#version-numbers-human-owned).
